# Trivy ignore list for the publish-gate image scan.
#
# The scan fails on fixable HIGH/CRITICAL vulnerabilities. If a finding has no
# fix yet, or is not reachable in our usage, add its CVE id here WITH an expiry
# date and a one-line reason, and re-evaluate at that date — never a silent,
# permanent exclusion.
#
# Format:
#   CVE-YYYY-NNNNN  # expires 2026-12-31 — <reason>
#
# (No entries yet.)
